      <slug></slug>
      <title>MINIX 3 and BSD</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>BSD Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;MINIX 3 is a BSD-licensed operating system focused on dependability. To improve the user experience, the MINIX team has been working to provide a more BSD-like environment on MINIX 3. This talk will describe our current progress on this front and our plans for the future.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
